cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software as shown below."
title: "FDE: Feasible Diverse Ensembles for tabular classification"
abstract: >-
  FDE builds a diverse ensemble around the best tuned single learner and keeps the ensemble only when a
  cross-fitted acceptance rule shows, on the training data, that it beats that learner.
